  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2046615097812865502",
      "reply_text": "Mind-bending indeed. Dominant force on that end.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:17:37.494198+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2046617999910559834",
      "reply_text": "Tatum's shooting percentages are still really high. That's what's making him so tough to guard.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:18:19.495782+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MattSakR2NG/status/2046621874327634418",
      "reply_text": "That's a pretty big gap. Defense matters in March.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:19:06.943025+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/1010XL/status/2046619588599677134",
      "reply_text": "Not surprised. He's still a top prospect.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:19:48.326164+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/billhpicks/status/2046619973108289558",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, he's been hot. 63% hit rate is crazy.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:20:29.051681+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheLukaVerse/status/2046610516328796388",
      "reply_text": "Not a coincidence. Refs can swing a lot. Shai's work ethic didn't change",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:21:22.026815+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAMEX/status/2046612619335967193",
      "reply_text": "Cavs blowing out at home was a surprise for me.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:21:57.865833+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NetsDaily/status/2046607241642451048",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough call. Would've loved to see Scoot Henderson in green, though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:22:52.546414+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KuKhahil/status/2046621013933195306",
      "reply_text": "Cool to see you getting some court time. St C's must have a sweet court",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:32:30.497111+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RodWalkerNola/status/2046622559345529116",
      "reply_text": "That's a good point about their past overlap. Wonder if that'll be a factor in the search.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:33:26.660610+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/zinzy_js/status/2046596290331726310",
      "reply_text": "Fair point, but a max deal might be tough to swallow if he's not an All-NBA selection.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:34:06.914205+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/EvanXeno/status/2046588471276437867",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's a tough way to lose. Starting five's scoring drought is a huge issue.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:34:40.001960+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ZRob4444/status/2046623183155999165",
      "reply_text": "Taco Tuesday sweep? You're hyping up the wrong team, buddy.",
