    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/saltcitysportut/status/2046609872347869657",
      "reply_text": "Players waiving no trade clauses to come to Utah doesn't change the team's overall roster or talent level. Still a long way to go.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T17:48:58.255014+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Newgodflow11/status/2046613978739290233",
      "reply_text": "Love's accolades speak louder than Pau's. 4x all star and 2x All NBA 2nd team > 1x all star",
